{"authorDailyContributionsMap":{"preyjwal":[{"date":"2026-09-30T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"610fe12f5c081ddbb19ec8972f8db7531eb88ec0","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Add Prakash Prajwal\u0027s details to About Us page","messageBody":"The About Us page still lists placeholder team members, one of which\nis \"Johnny Doe\" with a stock photo and GitHub link.\n\nReplace that placeholder with my name, photo and GitHub profile.\nRemove the portfolio link, as the Project Portfolio Page is an\noptional deliverable that has not been opted into yet.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":3,"deletions":3}}},{"hash":"6f9c6d28bcd528ae248caeead91d394227b486ba","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #15 from preyjwal/add-photo","messageBody":"Add Prajwal\u0027s photo","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"6ccf2295106ebda40b32c5b347088447e10ccb23","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Update Prakash Prajwal\u0027s responsibilities on About Us page","messageBody":"The About Us page still lists the placeholder responsibility \"Data\"\nfor my entry, carried over from the \"Johnny Doe\" template.\n\nReplace it with my actual responsibilities, documentation and the\nStorage component, so the page reflects the team\u0027s division of work.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":1,"deletions":1}}},{"hash":"bdc30a2cc5978bc5566f501bfaa5b662eeafd09e","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Update team contact email on About Us page","messageBody":"The About Us page still shows the template\u0027s contact address,\nseer[at]comp.nus.edu.sg, which does not reach our team.\n\nReplace it with an address the team actually uses.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":1,"deletions":1}}},{"hash":"4416867ed5bcfe1c6729f8669af711f5e96f9645","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Shorten Storage responsibility on About Us page","messageBody":"Teammates list their responsibilities are supposed to be listed by component name a